        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sulemani okwebeeka ang’e koagacha Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Amg 2:1-18)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu, omorwoti o Turo ekero aigwete ng’a Sulemani oakirwe amaguta na obeire omorwoti ribaga ria ise, agatoma abasomba baye asare, ekiagera Hiramu botambe igo anchete Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Sulemani agatoma amang’ana ase Hiramu, akabora,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nomanyete ng’a Daudi tata tanyarete koagacha enyomba ase ogosasimera erieta ri’Omonene, Nyasae oye, ekiagera ababisa nigo baarenge komorwania chiseegi chinsemo chionsi, goika ekero Omonene ababeegete inse ase obogaambi bwa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende bono Omonene, Nyasae one, ong’eire obotoereru korwa ase kera ensemo; ababisa tibari aande, gose amabe ande onsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nigo ateebeetie Daudi tata: Omwana oo oria ndabeeke abe ase ekerogo kiao ki’obonene magega yao, nere orang’agachere enyomba aase mogosasimera erieta riane. Ase ayio, naganirie koagacha enyomba aase togosasimera erieta ri’Omonene, Nyasae one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bono aye, chiika abanto bangechere emete emecharake ya Lebanoni. Abasomba baane mbabwatane nabasomba bao ase emeremo eyio, na inche ning’akane abasomba bao eng’eria ende yonsi orabeeke. Nomanyete ng’a abanto baane tibamanyeti kogecha emete buna abanto ba Sidoni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Hiramu aigwete amang’ana a Sulemani, akaba nomogooko omonene, akabora, “Omonene atogigwe rituko ria reero, oyo oeire Daudi omwana omomura omong’aini agambere abanto aba abange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agatoma amang’ana ase Sulemani, agateeba: “Naigure amang’ana gwatomire ase ’nde; igo inde ang’e gokora onsi aya oganetie ase amang’ana ’emete emecharake na emetarakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasomba baane mbayetirimbokie korwa ase Lebanoni gochia ase enyancha, nainche ninyebeke amo inyesibe, eirwe nenyancha echeng’enenete, goika aase oganetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Aase agwo nao erasansorerwe, na aye oyerusieo. Erio ong’isanekerie okogania kwane ase okobaa abanto baane endagera yabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu akaa Sulemani emete, emecharake na emetarakwa buna Sulemani aganetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani akaa Hiramu obosie bw’engano ebitonga chilifu amagana abere (200,000) koba endagera ase abanto b’enyomba yaye, na amaguta amitire korwa ase amazeituni chilita chilifu isano na ibere, na amagana abere (7,200). Ebinto ebio Sulemani akaba okoa Hiramu ase kera omwaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akaa Sulemani obong’aini buna amorierete eira. Omorembe okaba ase egati ya Hiramu na Sulemani, na aba babere bagakora okobwatana gw’okoigwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti Sulemani agakora omooroberio bw’abaanto chilifu emerongo etato (30,000) korwa ase Abaisraeli bonsi, akababeeka bakore emeremo yagwenerete gokorwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agaatanana abanto aba ase ebiombe bitato, kera ekeombe gekaba abanto chilifu ikomi. Kera ekeombe gekaba kegokora emeremo agwo Lebanoni ase omotienyi oyomo na kobeera inka ase emetienyi ebere. Adoniramu akabeekwa gotenenera emeremo eyio yagwenerete gokorwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo Sulemani nabwate abanto chilifu emerongo etano na ebere (70,000) abaarenge kobogoria chigurube, na abanto chilifu emerongo etano na etato (80,000) abaarenge kobaacha amagena agwo ase ebitunwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Sulemani nabwate abanto chilifu isato na amagana atato (3,300) batenenerete abanto baarenge gokora emeremo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akabachika baabaache amagena amanene aye rigori rinene, erinde oboroso bw’enyomba bobekwe amagena abaachire buya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo abaagachi ba Sulemani, na aba Hiramu amo nabaanto b’omochie o Gebali bagakora emeremo y’okobaacha na gosenia amagena na koroisia chibao ase oboagacho boria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
